==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Hiker}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
The {{tc|Hiker}} Trainer class is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. This card's artwork features the Hiker's appearance from the [[Generation IV]] games.

